<title>CANADA: Gardiner committee to mull Poco bid.</title>
<headline>Gardiner committee to mull Poco bid.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gardiner Oil &amp; Gas said on Wednesday it formed a special committee of independent directors to review and respond to a C$225 million takeover offer from Poco Petroleums Ltd.</p>
<p>The special committee consists of John O'Brien, Pat Shouldice and John Stout.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
